"复制链接后在窗口中按 ⌘V 即可下载，也可拖入链接或种子文件；装好浏览器扩展后，网页上点下载会直接交给闪电全能下载。" = "Copy a link and press ⌘V in the window, or drag in a link or torrent file. With the browser extension installed, downloads you start on a web page go straight to Shandian.";
"磁力、种子和其他下载默认存到「下载」，可在设置中选择保存位置。" = "Magnet, torrent and other downloads go to Downloads by default. You can change the location in Settings.";
"下载中的电影可「边下边播」：先下片头，用 IINA 或 VLC 打开。" = "Movies can be played while downloading: Shandian fetches the opening first, then opens it in IINA or VLC.";
"网盘下载需先在浏览器中获取直链，速度受网盘自身限速影响。" = "Cloud drive downloads need a direct link from your browser. Speed depends on the drive's own limits.";
"下载速度取决于资源热度、来源数量和网络环境。" = "Download speed depends on how popular a file is, the number of sources and your network.";
"闪电全能下载是一款 Mac 下载工具。磁力链接、种子文件、ed2k、HTTP 直链、网盘直链，以及 B 站、YouTube 等视频网站的内容，都在同一个窗口下载。链接类型自动识别，文件按类型保存到不同位置；关闭窗口后下载继续，菜单栏显示当前速度。" = "Shandian is a download manager for Mac. Magnet links, torrent files, ed2k, HTTP links, cloud drive links and video sites such as Bilibili and YouTube all download in one window. Link types are detected automatically and files are saved by type. Downloads continue after you close the window, with the current speed in the menu bar.";
"全部代码以 GPL-3.0 许可公开，下载内核为开源项目 Gopeed 的定制版本，视频下载由 yt-dlp 提供。欢迎在 GitHub 提交问题、建议或代码。" = "All code is published under GPL-3.0. The download engine is a customized version of the open-source Gopeed, and video downloads are powered by yt-dlp. Issues, suggestions and code are welcome on GitHub.";
"小红书、新片场、抖音：在浏览器里打开视频页，点扩展里的「下载这个视频」。视频号：粘贴分享链接后按提示操作，需要登录腾讯元宝。" = "Xiaohongshu, Xinpianchang, Douyin: open the video page in your browser and choose “Download this video” in the extension. WeChat Channels: paste the share link and follow the steps; this requires signing in to Tencent Yuanbao.";
